"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-y-xl\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-y-xl wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-primary\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-primary\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">Where do I start in setting up my shop?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">Contact our team and share your vision—we\'ll develop a strategic plan to bring it to life.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-sm wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontStyle\":\"normal\",\"fontWeight\":\"500\"}},\"className\":\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-primary\"} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading nfd-text-md nfd-text-primary\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:500\">How can I handle invitations for customers?</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\"} --><p class=\"nfd-text-faded nfd-text-base\">Our comprehensive online customer management platform includes a user-friendly <em>\"Invitations\"</em> module that empowers you (or us) to easily manage invites.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:group --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-y-xl\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} --><div class=\"nfd-gap-y-xl wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"nfd-gap-sm\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} 