49 6.249 16.379 6.249 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										الانتشار العالمي لأعمالنا\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<a href=\"https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/contact/\">تواصل معنا </a>				\n					<h3>قصتنا </h3>				\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"441\" src=\"https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/male-electrician-with-electric-cable-on-a-black-background-copy-space-e1651097469445-1024x565.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/male-electrician-with-electric-cable-on-a-black-background-copy-space-e1651097469445-1024x565.jpg 1024w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/male-electrician-with-electric-cable-on-a-black-background-copy-space-e1651097469445-300x165.jpg 300w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/male-electrician-with-electric-cable-on-a-black-background-copy-space-e1651097469445-768x424.jpg 768w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/male-electrician-with-electric-cable-on-a-black-background-copy-space-e1651097469445-1536x847.jpg 1536w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/male-electrician-with-electric-cable-on-a-black-background-copy-space-e1651097469445-600x331.jpg 600w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/male-electrician-with-electric-cable-on-a-black-background-copy-space-e1651097469445.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n					<h3>رؤيتنا</h3>				\n		<p>أن نكون من الشركات الرائدة في تجارة واستيراد الكابلات والأسلاك والمواد الكهربائية بالمملكة من خلال تقديم منتجات ذات جودة عالية وحلول مبتكرة تلبي احتياجات السوق وتساهم في تطوير البنية التحتية الكهربائية.</p>		\n					<h3>رسالتنا</h3>				\n		<p>في تنوير الخليج نلتزم بتوفير منتجات كهربائية موثوقة ومتنوعة بأسعار تنافسية مع تعزيز الشراكات الاستراتيجية لتقديم أفضل الحلول التي تخدم المشاريع والموردين وفق أعلى معايير الجودة والسلامة.</p>		\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/choosing-elecrical-sockets-in-the-shop-e1650781303930-1024x684.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/choosing-elecrical-sockets-in-the-shop-e1650781303930-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/choosing-elecrical-sockets-in-the-shop-e1650781303930-300x200.jpg 300w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/choosing-elecrical-sockets-in-the-shop-e1650781303930-768x513.jpg 768w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/choosing-elecrical-sockets-in-the-shop-e1650781303930-1536x1026.jpg 1536w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/choosing-elecrical-sockets-in-the-shop-e1650781303930-600x401.jpg 600w, https://yousab-tech.com/website_2dd1b86c/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/choosing-elecrical-sockets-in-the-shop-e1650781303930.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n					<h2>قيمنا</h2>				\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 480H48c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48V80c0-26.51 21.49-48 48-48h352c26.51 0 48 21.49 48 48v352c0 26.51-21.49 48-48 48zm-204.686-98.059l184-184c6.248-6.248 6.248-16.379 0-22.627l-22.627-22.627c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.249-22.628 0L184 302.745l-70.059-70.059c-6.248-6.248-16.379-6.248-22.628 0l-22.627 22.627c-6.248 6.248-6.248 16.379 0 22.627l104 104c6.249 6.25 16.379 6.25 22.628.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										الجودة والالتزام – تقديم منتجات وخدمات ذات معايير عالمية.\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 480H48c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48V80c0-26.51 21.49-48 48-48